{"id":"P1-V2-009","category":"single_spec_numeric","question":"GB 50157-2013 的车辆外部运行噪声限值在什么测试条件下适用，限值是多少？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb50157"],"edition_ids":["2013"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb50157@2013"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb50157@2013":["4.1.18"]},"gold_answer":"列车在露天地面水平直线、有砟道床无缝钢轨上以60km/h运行，在车外距轨道中心7.5m、距轨面高1.5m处测得的连续等效噪声不大于80dB(A)。","required_requirements":["线路、轨道和速度条件","测点位置","噪声限值"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"60/7.5/1.5/80","unit":"km/h/m/m/dB(A)","conditions":["露天地面水平直线、有砟道床无缝钢轨"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb50157@2013","pdf_page":38,"article":"4.1.18","source_excerpt":"60km/h，距中心7.5m、高1.5m，≤80dB(A)。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
