{"id":"P1-V2-015","category":"single_spec_conditions","question":"GB 55033-2022 如何划分地下车站主体、出入口、机电设备集中区段与区间隧道等结构的防水等级？","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.gb55033"],"edition_ids":["2022"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.gb55033@2022"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.5.8"]},"gold_answer":"地下车站主体、出入口和机电设备集中区段为一级；区间隧道、联络通道、风井等附属结构不低于二级；高架桥面设柔性防水层和顺畅排水系统。","required_requirements":["一级适用对象","二级适用对象","高架桥面措施"],"numeric_expectations":[],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":26,"article":"5.5.8","source_excerpt":"地下重点部位一级，区间及附属不低于二级。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
{"id":"P1-V2-019","category":"cross_spec_numeric","question":"比较三份规范对主体结构或重要结构设计年限的直接规定，并说明50年条款的适用边界。","requested_scope":{"spec_ids":["cn.beijing.db11t995","cn.gb55033","cn.gb50157"],"edition_ids":["2025","2022","2013"]},"expected_behavior":"answer","answerable":true,"expected_spec_editions":["cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","cn.gb55033@2022","cn.gb50157@2013"],"expected_articles_by_spec":{"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025":["3.0.13"],"cn.gb55033@2022":["5.1.3"],"cn.gb50157@2013":["1.0.12"]},"gold_answer":"三者对主体或严重影响运营安全的重要结构均规定不低于100年；DB11和GB 55033另将不严重影响运营安全的其他/可更换结构规定为不低于50年，GB 50157给定条文未给出该50年分类。","required_requirements":["三规范100年对象","50年仅绑定有直接证据的规范"],"numeric_expectations":[{"value":"100/50","unit":"年","conditions":["按结构重要性和可更换性区分"]}],"source_references":[{"business_id":"cn.beijing.db11t995@2025","pdf_page":29,"article":"3.0.13","source_excerpt":"重要结构100年，可更换构件50年。"},{"business_id":"cn.gb55033@2022","pdf_page":22,"article":"5.1.3","source_excerpt":"主体和重要结构100年，其他结构50年。"},{"business_id":"cn.gb50157@2013","pdf_page":21,"article":"1.0.12","source_excerpt":"主体及严重影响运营安全结构不低于100年。"}],"why_unanswerable":null}
